+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,13 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Commands
+
+* `analyzeLandscape` (`-analysisRoot <folder>`): creates or updates a landscape report in `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape`, aggregating the repository analyses found under the analysis root. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command as `analyzeLandscape`, kept for backward compatibility with existing scripts.
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
+
